{"version":1,"content":"<p>昨晚（12日）11時許，警方接獲一名男子報案，指在新蒲崗六合街29號宏輝工業大廈一單位內遭妻子持剪刀襲擊。</p><p>警方與救護員接報到場，47歲姓鄧男事主胸口及手臂受傷，清醒送往伊利沙伯醫院。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-13T02:20:50.406954+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":92,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T01:49:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-13T07:18:45.301800+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-13T02:17:51.056169+00:00","content_hash":"3222e30642e3978348297db061b0911b3925723295085953f45007eeb10ddccb","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}